{"articleNo":"166964","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=166964&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2017학년도 신입생 및 편입생 학번 조회","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2017.02.17","hit":"9681","attachments":[{"name":"2017학년도 신입생 (2017-1학기) 수강신청 안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=166964&attachNo=4824"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">2017학년도&nbsp;신입생 및 편입생 학번 조회</span></strong></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2017학년도 신입생 및 편입생의 학번이 부여되어있으니 확인하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">1. 학번&nbsp;조회는 2월 20일(월)부터 가능합니다.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ [<a href=\"http://kumohweb.kumoh.ac.kr/mybsvr/scr/sno_search.html\" target=\"_blank\">학번 조회 바로가기</a>]</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2. 학번 조회 후 원스톱서비스에 가입하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp; 1) 원스톱서비스 경로</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 학교홈페이지<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><font color=\"#000000\">→Quick menu<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">→원스톱서비스<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">→신규등록[<a href=\"http://kumohweb.kumoh.ac.kr/mybsvr/login/onestop.html\" target=\"_blank\">신규등록 바로가기</a>]</span></span></font></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 원스톱서비스 기능</span></span></font></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 학적자료 및 수강신청/시간표 조회가능</span></span></font></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) 기타 및